> Now, I'd like to provide an abstraction around all of this, and I would like your help in building it. Chat dialogues are the main input, and thumbs-up-down on the results are the main feedback. The purpose of the abstraction is to select specific models and tools to respond with.  It's goal (roughly) should be to produce a response that is most likely to get a thumbs-up, for minimum cost and minimum latency.
> 
